(The entire Bible tells ONE story. Here it is in 5 parts:) Tj
ET
BT
0.200 0.200 0.400 rg
/F2 11 Tf
55.0 609.8 Td
(  1. CREATION) Tj
ET
BT
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 10 Tf
70.0 594.4 Td
(God created everything good. He made people to know and love Him. \(Genesis 1-2\)) Tj
ET
BT
0.200 0.200 0.400 rg
/F2 11 Tf
55.0 572.4 Td
(  2. THE FALL) Tj
ET
BT
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 10 Tf
70.0 557.0 Td
(Humanity chose to disobey God \(sin\), breaking our relationship with Him. Every person) Tj
ET
BT
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 10 Tf
70.0 543.0 Td
(is affected by sin. \(Genesis 3, Romans 3:23\)) Tj
ET
BT
0.200 0.200 0.400 rg
/F2 11 Tf
55.0 521.0 Td
(  3. THE PROMISE) Tj
ET
BT
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 10 Tf
70.0 505.6 Td
(God promised to send a Savior who would fix what was broken. The entire Old Testament) Tj
ET
BT
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 10 Tf
70.0 491.6 Td
(points to this coming Rescuer. \(Genesis 3:15, Isaiah 53\)) Tj
ET
BT
0.200 0.200 0.400 rg
/F2 11 Tf
55.0 469.6 Td
(  4. JESUS) Tj
ET
BT
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 10 Tf
70.0 454.2 Td
(God Himself came as a human - Jesus. He lived a perfect life, died on the cross to pay) Tj
ET
BT
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 10 Tf
70.0 440.2 Td
(for our sins, and rose from the dead. \(John 1:14, Romans 5:8, 1 Cor 15:3-4\)) Tj
ET
BT
0.200 0.200 0.400 rg
/F2 11 Tf
55.0 418.2 Td
(  5. RESTORATION) Tj
ET
BT
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 10 Tf
70.0 402.8 Td
(Through faith in Jesus, we are forgiven and restored to relationship with God. One day) Tj
ET
BT
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 10 Tf
70.0 388.8 Td
